Z||000000||Gokart||12-30-1999||10:21 PM||||I have a factory service manual on the way I won on e-bay and I'm psyched cause no ones ever working on my car again BUT ME! Took my GT into someone I thought I could trust to do the job right and I believe I was mistaken! I had a oil leak coming from the distributer. The one that was in my parts car seemed in better shape cause it turned more freely. So I gave them that to put in along with a new factory o-ring and told them to set the timing as well. I picked it up after they had already closed and could tell before I even moved something was wrong, wasn't idleing around 1000 like it always does. It runs like crap and I don't know if its cause they didn't set the timing or the used distributer was no good? On top of it they must have removed the deck lid cause its not shutting right. Hits the edge of the drivers side grill. AND they put the oily distributer that was in my car on the passengers side floor. I'M PISSED! ||||reg||1
